alse","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":9395,"output":1240,"cacheRead":1408,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_8NK1Nbztu3p5JTDMhvInEqPY","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Atoken-status-unspecified::entry%3Aget-shared","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"unknown"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared entry, the source first resolves the supplied token through getActiveMemoShare. If the token exists and is not expired, the handler fetches the memo by the share's MemoID, rejects missing, inactive, or SPACE memos with NOT_FOUND, then builds a read context using that exact MemoID as SharedMemoID and allows the memo when the read decision permits it. For the assumed active, private, non-SPACE memo with a valid creator, the share-applies control is true for the exact memo, so the private visibility check returns an allowed private-read decision; the handler then proceeds to list related data and returns the memo. If the token is absent or expired, getActiveMemoShare returns NOT_FOUND before memo access evaluation. An inaccessible or otherwise rejected memo visible in this entry is also mapped to NOT_FOUND when the memo is missing, inactive, SPACE, or the resolved read decision is not allowed; creator-conversion failure is likewise mapped to NOT_FOUND. A single concrete observed outcome cannot be selected because token existence and expiry are unspecified. The anonymous premise is not itself proof that the token resolves, and no separate requested memo identity is introduced.","facts":[{"id":"entry-get-shared","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo begins by resolving the supplied share token and, on success, fetches the memo identified by the share record.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":180}]},{"id":"binding-anonymous-share","kind":"binding","statement":"The successful read context is built for the resolved memo with the share record's MemoID supplied as the shared-memo binding.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"resource-exact-memo","kind":"binding","statement":"The shared-read authorization applies only when the context's shared memo ID equals the memo ID and the memo is not SPACE-audience.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":113,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"control-share-bypasses-private","kind":"control","statement":"For a structurally valid memo, the exact applicable share returns a private read class before the ordinary private-visibility branch that would reject an inactive viewer.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":95},{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":113,"endLine":145}]},{"id":"effect-return-memo","kind":"effect","statement":"After an allowed read decision, the handler lists reactions and attachments, converts the memo, clears its parent, and returns the memo message.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":186,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"condition-valid-token","kind":"condition","statement":"A missing share record or an expired share is mapped to NOT_FOUND before the memo is fetched.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":216,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"condition-inaccessible-memo","kind":"condition","statement":"A missing, inactive, or SPACE memo, or a memo whose read decision is not allowed, is mapped to NOT_FOUND within GetSharedMemo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"condition-invalid-creator","kind":"condition","statement":"The read decision fails closed when the memo is absent or its creator is invalid; creator-conversion failure is also mapped to NOT_FOUND by the handler.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":101},{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":203,"endLine":208}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied share token resolves to a share record.","Whether the resolved share has expired at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe whether GetMemoShare for the supplied token returns a share record.","If it returns a share record, observe its expiry value and whether isMemoShareExpired is true at evaluation time."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":9395,"output":1240,"cacheRead":1408,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":52933.539499999984,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:20:17.068Z"}}
