ate requested memo identity or deployment fact is assumed.","facts":[{"id":"entry-get-shared","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo resolves the supplied share token and, after successful resolution, fetches the memo identified by the share record.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":180}]},{"id":"binding-exact-share-memo","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler builds the memo read context with the resolved share record's memo ID as the shared-memo binding.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"resource-exact-memo","kind":"binding","statement":"The share condition applies only when the shared memo ID equals the memo ID being evaluated and the memo is not SPACE-audience.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":113,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"control-share-allows-private","kind":"control","statement":"For a structurally valid memo, an applicable exact share returns an allowed private-read class before the ordinary private-visibility checks for an inactive viewer.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":95},{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":113,"endLine":145}]},{"id":"effect-return-memo","kind":"effect","statement":"After an allowed read decision, the handler lists reactions and attachments, converts the memo, clears its parent, and returns the memo message.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":186,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"condition-invalid-expired-token","kind":"condition","statement":"A missing share record or an expired share is returned as NOT_FOUND before the memo is fetched.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":216,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"condition-inaccessible-memo","kind":"condition","statement":"A missing, inactive, or SPACE memo, or a memo with a denied read decision, is returned as NOT_FOUND within GetSharedMemo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"condition-invalid-creator","kind":"condition","statement":"The read decision fails closed for an absent or invalid creator, and creator-conversion failure is mapped to NOT_FOUND by the handler.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":101},{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":203,"endLine":208}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied share token resolves to a share record.","Whether the resolved share is expired at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe whether resolving the supplied token returns a share record.","If a share record is returned, observe its expiry value and whether the expiry check is true at evaluation time."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":12139,"output":969,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":20155.128400000016,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:20:37.224Z"}}
